```

Install the missing dependencies (PETSc, boost, HDF5, Kokkos) through the Xolotl cmake process:
```
mkdir build
cd build
cmake -DXolotl_BUILD_PETSC=ON -DXolotl_BUILD_HYPRE=ON -DCMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=Release -DCMAKE_INSTALL_PREFIX=/projects/NE_SciDAC/LDRD/coupling_xolotl/xolotl/install ../
export PETSC_DIR=/projects/NE_SciDAC/LDRD/coupling_xolotl/xolotl/build/external/petsc_install
```

Install libmesh and wasp from MOOSE:
```
cd ../../moose
MOOSE_JOBS=10 ./scripts/update_and_rebuild_libmesh.sh
./scripts/update_and_rebuild_wasp.sh
```

Finally, build the coupling code:
```
cd ..
git apply coupling.patch
make
```
